            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 44-626, Hygienic Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis hygienic germ free, hands free design 8-7/8\" long hospital door pull is made from solid cast brass and finished in satin chrome. The easy use and clean style makes it great for any office, hospital, school and restaurant  doors. Packaged with surface mounting hardware (screws to the doors face).\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nADA compliant hygienic hands free design - Door can be opened with the forearm.  Great for commercial restroom doors.  \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\"><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap\"></a>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo 44-626 Hospital Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Pull Length: 8-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center (CTC): 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Clearance: 2-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Chrome</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with #10 x 1\" Sheet Metal Screws</li>\r\n<li>ADA Compliant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold individually (1 door pull handle).</b>\r\n</p>",
